---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
    title="App"
    app
    description="Message through a Tern node from your browser, over USB or Bluetooth. Nothing leaves your device but what the node sends by radio."
>
    <section class="app">
        <!-- Until a node is connected, the page is where one is connected from. -->
        <div id="gate" class="gate">
            <p class="eyebrow">Web app</p>
            <h1>Connect to your node</h1>
            <p class="lede">
                Write to other nodes through a Tern node of your own. The page talks to the node and to
                nothing else: no account, no server, and what you write leaves this device only by the
                node's radio.
            </p>
            <!-- A node's bootloader taking an update: the node has restarted into it, and is not connected. -->
            <div id="bootloader" class="card update" hidden></div>
            <div class="choices">
                <button id="connect-serial" type="button" class="choice">
                    <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v14M8 6l4-4 4 4M7 11v3h10v-3M12 16v6" /><circle cx="12" cy="20" r="0.5" /></svg>
                    </span>
                    <span class="choice-title">USB cable</span>
                    <span class="choice-text">A board plugged into this computer</span>
                </button>
                <button id="connect-bluetooth" type="button" class="choice">
                    <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 7l10 10-5 5V2l5 5L7 17" /></svg>
                    </span>
                    <span class="choice-title">Bluetooth</span>
                    <span class="choice-text">A node in reach of this computer or Android phone</span>
                </button>
                <button id="connect-demo" type="button" class="choice">
                    <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" /></svg>
                    </span>
                    <span class="choice-title">Try the demo</span>
                    <span class="choice-text">A made-up node, with no board needed</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <p id="turned-off" class="note" hidden>
                Turned off. The node stays off until it is turned on at the node itself, by its button,
                its reset or its power; then connect to it again.
            </p>
            <p id="unsupported" class="note" hidden></p>
            <div class="tips">
                <h2>Good to know</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>No Tern on the board yet?</strong>{" "}
                        <a href="/flash">Flash it</a> from this browser first.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Pairing.</strong> Over Bluetooth, the node asks for a passkey the first
                        time: it is on the node's screen. A node with no screen pairs within three minutes
                        of a press of its button or of being turned on. The node's <code>forget</code>
                        command, over USB, makes every device pair again.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Your messages.</strong> Conversations are also kept in this browser, since
                        a node remembers only its latest messages. A chat you delete goes from here too.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Your position.</strong> Shared from here, the node has the browser's location
                        only while this page is open: for sharing from a pocket, use a{" "}
                        <a href="/apps">phone app</a>.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>An alpha.</strong> This is an alpha of a draft protocol. Its cryptography has
                        not been reviewed: do not trust it with anything that matters.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- A node is connected: Chats, People and Node, as the phone apps have them. -->
        <div id="live" class="shell" hidden>
            <nav class="tabs" aria-label="App">
                <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="chats">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z" /></svg>
                    <span class="tab-label">Chats</span>
                    <span id="unread-total" class="badge" hidden></span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="people">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"
                        ><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5" /><path d="M2.5 20c.6-3.6 3.2-5.5 6.5-5.5s5.9 1.9 6.5 5.5" /><path
                            d="M16 4.8a3.5 3.5 0 010 6.4M18.5 14.8c1.7.8 2.8 2.5 3 5.2"></path></svg
                    >
                    <span class="tab-label">People</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="node">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"
                        ><rect x="6" y="9" width="12" height="12" rx="2"></rect><path
                            d="M12 9V3M8.5 5.5a5 5 0 017 0M6 3a8.5 8.5 0 0112 0"></path></svg
                    >
                    <span class="tab-label">Node</span>
                    <span id="update-dot" class="dot-badge" hidden></span>
                </button>
            </nav>

            <div class="main">
                <header class="topbar">
                    <button id="node-pill" type="button" class="node-pill" title="Show the node">
                        <span class="dot"></span>
                        <span id="pill-name"></span>
                        <span id="pill-battery" class="muted"></span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="manage-pill" type="button" class="pill manage" title="Show what is under way" hidden></button>
                    <span id="demo-note" class="pill demo" hidden>
                        Demo: names and messages are made up
                    </span>
                </header>

                <section id="pane-chats" class="pane chats" aria-label="Chats">
                    <div class="list-col">
                        <div class="col-head">
                            <h2>Chats</h2>
                            <div class="head-actions">
                                <button id="new-contact" type="button" class="small" title="Add someone by their address">
                                    + Contact
                                </button>
                                <button id="new-group" type="button" class="small" title="Make or join a group">
                                    + Group
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <ul id="asked" class="asked"></ul>
                        <ul id="talks" class="talks"></ul>
                    </div>
                    <section id="talk" class="talk">
                        <header id="talk-head" class="talk-head"></header>
                        <ol id="messages" class="messages"></ol>
                        <form id="compose" class="compose" hidden>
                            <label for="text" class="sr">Message</label>
                            <input id="text" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Write a message" />
                            <span id="counter" class="muted"></span>
                            <button type="submit" class="primary send" aria-label="Send">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12l16-8-6 16-2.5-6.5z" /></svg>
                                <span>Send</span>
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    </section>
                </section>

                <section id="pane-people" class="pane people" aria-label="People" hidden>
                    <div class="pane-head">
                        <h2>People</h2>
                        <p class="muted">Your contacts and groups, and the nodes this one hears about it.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cards">
                        <section class="card">
                            <h3>Contacts</h3>
                            <ul id="people" class="rows"></ul>
                            <form id="add" class="add-form">
                                <h4>Add someone</h4>
                                <label for="add-address">Their node's address</label>
                                <input id="add-address" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="64 hex digits, or its link" required />
                                <label for="add-name">Name</label>
                                <input id="add-name" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="31" placeholder="for you; never sent by radio" />
                                <button type="submit" class="primary">Add contact</button>
                            </form>
                        </section>

                        <section class="card" id="groups-card">
                            <h3>Groups</h3>
                            <ul id="groups" class="rows"></ul>
                            <p id="groups-old" class="muted small-print" hidden>
                                This node's firmware is from before groups. <a href="/flash">Update it</a> to
                                make and join them.
                            </p>
                            <p id="groups-demo" class="muted small-print" hidden>The demo has no groups.</p>
                            <form id="group-add" class="add-form">
                                <h4>Make a group</h4>
                                <label for="group-name">Name</label>
                                <input id="group-name" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="31" placeholder="for you; never sent by radio" required />
                                <button type="submit" class="primary">Make group</button>
                            </form>
                            <form id="group-join" class="add-form" hidden>
                                <h4>Join a group</h4>
                                <label for="join-code">Its join code</label>
                                <input id="join-code" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="HTTPS://TERNMESH.ORG/G#…" required />
                                <button type="submit">Join</button>
                            </form>
                        </section>

                        <section class="card" id="about-card">
                            <h3 id="about-head">Who's about</h3>
                            <p class="muted small-print">
                                Nodes near this one that have turned their presence card on. A name is what
                                its sender says it is.
                            </p>
                            <ul id="about" class="rows"></ul>
                        </section>

                        <section class="card">
                            <h3>Heard nearby</h3>
                            <p class="muted small-print">The nodes this one hears directly, strongest first.</p>
                            <ul id="neighbours" class="rows"></ul>
                            <p id="neighbours-bare" class="muted small-print" hidden></p>
                            <p id="neighbours-leaf" class="muted small-print" hidden>
                                Handhelds (leaves) answer traces only from nodes they have a secure session with.
                            </p>
                        </section>

                        <section class="card" id="places-card">
                            <h3 id="places-head">Positions</h3>
                            <ul id="places" class="rows"></ul>
                        </section>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section id="pane-node" class="pane node" aria-label="Node" hidden>
                    <div id="node" class="hero"></div>
                    <div id="update" class="card update" hidden></div>
                    <div class="cards">
                        <section id="settings" class="card">
                            <h3>Radio</h3>
                            <form id="settings-form">
                                <label for="set-region">Region</label>
                                <select id="set-region">
                                    <option value="US915">
                                        US915: United States, Canada, Mexico, Brazil, Argentina, Peru
                                    </option>
                                    <option value="EU868">EU868: Europe, UK, Ukraine, South Africa</option>
                                    <option value="AU915">AU915: Australia</option>
                                    <option value="NZ915">NZ915: New Zealand</option>
                                    <option value="CL915">CL915: Chile</option>
                                    <option value="MY919">MY919: Malaysia</option>
                                    <option value="TH920">TH920: Thailand, at least 17 dBm radiated</option>
                                    <option value="RU868">RU868: Russia</option>
                                    <option value="KZ863">KZ863: Kazakhstan</option>
                                </select>
                                <label for="set-power">Transmit power, in dBm</label>
                                <div class="inline">
                                    <input id="set-power" type="number" min="-9" max="22" step="1" required />
                                    <button id="set-power-most" type="button" class="small" hidden>Use the most allowed</button>
                                </div>
                                <label for="set-role">Role</label>
                                <select id="set-role">
                                    <option value="1">Help the mesh: relay others' messages</option>
                                    <option value="0">Just me: send and receive my own</option>
                                </select>
                                <div id="receiver-setting" hidden>
                                    <label class="check"><input id="set-receiver" type="checkbox" /> Run its GPS</label>
                                    <p class="muted small-print">
                                        The GPS tells the node where it is, which it shares from only if you
                                        share your position. Off, it saves the battery, and the node keeps
                                        its last fix.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <p class="muted small-print">
                                    The board sends on its region's frequency: choose the one you are in.
                                    It restarts to apply a change, and refuses a power its region does not
                                    allow.
                                </p>
                                <button id="settings-apply" type="submit" class="primary">Apply</button>
                            </form>
                        </section>

                        <section id="card-settings" class="card" hidden>
                            <h3>Presence card</h3>
                            <form id="card-form">
                                <p id="card-state" class="state-line"></p>
                                <label class="check"><input id="card-on" type="checkbox" /> Show this node's card to nodes nearby</label>
                                <label for="card-name">The name on the card</label>
                                <input id="card-name" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="31" placeholder="empty for none; sent in clear" />
                                <p class="muted small-print">
                                    On, this node sends its address and this name to every node in range, two
                                    hops round, about every two hours, so anyone nearby can recognise it each
                                    time, and add it. Off, it puts neither on the air. It is off until you turn
                                    it on.
                                </p>
                                <button id="card-apply" type="submit" class="primary">Save</button>
                            </form>
                        </section>

                        <section id="sleep-settings" class="card" hidden>
                            <h3>Sleep</h3>
                            <form id="sleep-form">
                                <p id="sleep-state" class="state-line"></p>
                                <label class="check"><input id="sleep-on" type="checkbox" /> Sleep between wakes</label>
                                <label for="sleep-wake">Wake at least</label>
                                <select id="sleep-wake">
                                    <option value="300">every 5 min</option>
                                    <option value="600">every 10 min</option>
                                    <option value="900">every 15 min</option>
                                    <option value="1800">every 30 min</option>
                                    <option value="3600">every 1 h</option>
                                </select>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Advanced</summary>
                                    <label for="sleep-listen">Listen after each wake, in seconds</label>
                                    <input id="sleep-listen" type="number" min="2" max="255" step="1" required />
                                </details>
                                <p class="muted small-print">
                                    Asleep, the node turns its radio off between wakes to save its battery, and a
                                    relay near it keeps its messages until it wakes and asks for them. Messages to
                                    it wait that long. Only a node that sends and receives its own sleeps; a relay
                                    keeps the setting for when it does.
                                </p>
                                <button type="submit" class="primary">Apply</button>
                            </form>
                        </section>

                        <section id="range" class="card wide" hidden>
                            <h3>Range test</h3>
                            <p class="muted small-print">
                                Sends a contact a numbered message, “range #1”, “range #2” and on, every so often, and logs
                                each: where this device was, whether it was delivered and how. Keep this page open while you
                                move; the screen stays on where the browser allows it.
                            </p>
                            <div class="range-form">
                                <div>
                                    <label for="range-to">To</label>
                                    <select id="range-to"></select>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label for="range-every">Every</label>
                                    <select id="range-every">
                                        <option value="30">30 s</option>
                                        <option value="35">35 s</option>
                                        <option value="40">40 s</option>
                                        <option value="45">45 s</option>
                                        <option value="50">50 s</option>
                                        <option value="55">55 s</option>
                                        <option value="60">60 s</option>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="buttons range-buttons">
                                <button id="range-start" type="button" class="primary">Start</button>
                                <button id="range-stop" type="button" class="primary" hidden>Stop</button>
                                <button id="range-csv" type="button" hidden>Download CSV</button>
                            </p>
                            <p id="range-status" class="state-line"></p>
                            <p id="range-no-location" class="muted small-print" hidden>
                                No location: the log won't say where you were. Allow this site your location to have it.
                            </p>
                            <p id="range-needs-update" class="muted small-print" hidden>
                                This node's firmware says only whether each was delivered. Update it for hops, signal and round
                                trip.
                            </p>
                            <ul id="range-log" class="rows range-log"></ul>
                        </section>

                        <section class="card">
                            <h3>Connection</h3>
                            <p id="link-facts" class="muted small-print"></p>
                            <p class="buttons">
                                <button id="disconnect" type="button">Disconnect</button>
                                <button id="lock" type="button" hidden>Lock Bluetooth</button>
                                <button id="turn-off" type="button" class="danger" hidden>Turn the node off</button>
                                <button id="wipe" type="button" class="danger" hidden>Erase this node</button>
                            </p>
                        </section>

                        <section id="console" class="card wide" hidden>
                            <h3>The board's console</h3>
                            <pre id="console-text"></pre>
                            <form id="console-form" class="inline">
                                <label for="console-line" class="sr">A command for the board</label>
                                <input id="console-line" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="status, routes, peers…" />
                                <button type="submit">Send</button>
                            </form>
                        </section>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Asks before what cannot be undone, such as deleting a chat: the page fills it in each time. -->
        <dialog id="ask" class="ask" aria-labelledby="ask-title" aria-describedby="ask-body">
            <form method="dialog">
                <h2 id="ask-title"></h2>
                <div id="ask-body"></div>
                <div id="ask-also" hidden>
                    <label class="check"><input id="ask-also-box" type="checkbox" /> <span id="ask-also-text"></span></label>
                    <p id="ask-also-note" class="muted small-print"></p>
                </div>
                <p class="actions">
                    <button type="submit" value="cancel" autofocus>Cancel</button>
                    <button id="ask-yes" type="submit" value="yes" class="danger"></button>
                </p>
            </form>
        </dialog>

        <!-- A trace to one node (version 18): drawn again as it goes. -->
        <dialog id="trace" class="ask trace" aria-labelledby="trace-title">
            <form method="dialog">
                <h2 id="trace-title"></h2>
                <div id="trace-body"></div>
                <p class="actions">
                    <button id="trace-again" type="button" class="primary">Trace</button>
                    <button type="submit" value="close" autofocus>Close</button>
                </p>
            </form>
        </dialog>

        <!-- What there is to know of something, such as how a message went: the page fills it in. -->
        <dialog id="info" class="ask" aria-labelledby="info-title">
            <form method="dialog">
                <h2 id="info-title"></h2>
                <div id="info-body"></div>
                <p class="actions">
                    <button type="submit" value="close" autofocus>Close</button>
                </p>
            </form>
        </dialog>

        <div class="toast-wrap">
            <div id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="toast" hidden>
                <span id="status-text"></span>
                <button id="status-close" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss">×</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Base>

<script>
    import "../lib/app/main.ts";
</script>

<style is:global>
    /* Global, and under .app: the page's script makes most of these elements, and a scoped
       style would not reach them. */
    .app [hidden] {
        display: none !important;
    }
    .app .sr {
        position: absolute;
        width: 1px;
        height: 1px;
        overflow: hidden;
        clip-path: inset(50%);
    }
    .app svg {
        fill: none;
        stroke: currentColor;
        stroke-width: 1.8;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    /* ----- Controls ----- */
    .app button {
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        min-height: 38px;
        padding: 7px 14px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
            border-color 0.15s,
            background 0.15s,
            color 0.15s;
    }
    .app button:hover:not(:disabled) {
        border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .app button:disabled {
        opacity: 0.5;
        cursor: not-allowed;
    }
    .app button.primary {
        background: var(--accent);
        border-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--on-accent);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app button.primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
        background: var(--accent-hover);
        border-color: var(--accent-hover);
    }
    .app button.danger {
        color: var(--bad);
    }
    .app button.danger:hover:not(:disabled) {
        border-color: var(--bad);
    }
    .app button.small {
        min-height: 30px;
        padding: 3px 11px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .app .buttons,
    .app .actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .app input[type="text"],
    .app input[type="number"],
    .app select {
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 40px;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .app input:focus,
    .app select:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--accent);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft);
    }
    .app label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin: 12px 0 5px;
    }
    .app label.check {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .app .inline {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .app .inline input {
        flex: 1;
    }
    .app .inline button {
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app .small-print {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin: 8px 0 0;
    }
    .app .note {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 10px 14px;
    }
    .app .bad {
        color: var(--bad);
    }
    .app .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        padding: 0 6px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: var(--on-accent);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
    }
    .app .tag {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 1px 7px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: var(--surface-2);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        vertical-align: middle;
    }
    .app .tag.good {
        color: var(--good);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--good) 14%, transparent);
    }

    /* Avatars: a person's is round and a group's a rounded square, the same colour on every screen. */
    .app .avatar {
        flex: none;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .app .avatar.group {
        border-radius: 30%;
    }
    .app .avatar.sm {
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    .app .avatar.unknown {
        background: var(--surface-2);
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* ----- Before a node is connected ----- */
    .app .gate {
        max-width: 52rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 56px 16px 64px;
    }
    .app .gate h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
        margin: 8px 0 12px;
    }
    .app .gate .lede {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 40rem;
        margin: 0 0 28px;
    }
    .app .choices {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .app .choice {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
        grid-template-rows: auto auto;
        column-gap: 14px;
        row-gap: 2px;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: left;
        padding: 18px;
        min-height: 0;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .app .choice:hover:not(:disabled) {
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .app .choice-icon {
        grid-row: span 2;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        color: var(--accent);
    }
    .app .choice-icon svg {
        width: 22px;
        height: 22px;
    }
    .app .choice-title {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .app .choice-text {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .app .choice.primary .choice-title,
    .app .choice.primary .choice-text {
        color: var(--on-accent);
    }
    .app .choice.primary .choice-icon {
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.16);
        color: var(--on-accent);
    }
    .app .choice.primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
        background: var(--accent-hover);
    }
    .app .tips {
        margin-top: 36px;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .app .tips h2 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .app .tips ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 1.1em;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.93rem;
    }
    .app .tips li {
        padding: 4px 0;
    }
    .app .tips strong {
        color: var(--text);
    }

    /* ----- The app: tabs beside the panes, or under them on a phone ----- */
    body.is-app {
        min-height: 100dvh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    body.is-app main {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .app {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .app .shell {
        flex: 1;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 88px minmax(0, 1fr);
        min-height: calc(100dvh - var(--header-h) - 48px);
    }
    .app .shell.busy {
        opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .app .tabs {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        padding: 16px 10px;
        border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--surface);
    }
    .app .tab {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px;
        min-height: 0;
        padding: 10px 4px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app .tab svg {
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
    }
    .app .tab:hover:not(:disabled) {
        color: var(--text);
        background: var(--surface-2);
    }
    .app .tab[aria-current="page"] {
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
    }
    .app .tab .badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: 4px;
        right: 12px;
        min-width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
    }
    .app .dot-badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: 8px;
        right: 22px;
        width: 9px;
        height: 9px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--warn);
    }
    .app .main {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-width: 0;
    }
    .app .topbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .app .node-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        min-height: 32px;
        padding: 4px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--surface-2);
        border-color: transparent;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .app .node-pill .dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--good);
    }
    .app .pill.manage {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border-color: transparent;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        max-width: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app .pill.demo {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border-color: transparent;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
    }
    .app .pane {
        flex: 1;
        min-height: 0;
    }
    .app .pane.people,
    .app .pane.node {
        padding: 24px 20px 40px;
        max-width: 72rem;
        width: 100%;
    }
    .app .pane-head h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    .app .pane-head p {
        margin: 4px 0 20px;
    }
    .app .cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 21rem), 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: start;
    }
    .app .card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 18px 20px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .app .card.wide {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
    .app .card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .app .card h4 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .app .add-form {
        margin-top: 14px;
        padding-top: 14px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .app .add-form button[type="submit"] {
        margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .app form button[type="submit"] {
        margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .app .inline button[type="submit"] {
        margin-top: 0;
    }

    /* Rows in a card: an avatar, a name and what to know of it, and an action. */
    .app .rows {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 6px -8px 0;
        padding: 0;
    }
    .app .rows > li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 8px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
    }
    .app .rows > li.empty {
        display: block;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .app .row-button {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 0;
        padding: 8px;
        margin: 0 -8px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        background: transparent;
        text-align: left;
    }
    .app .rows > li:has(.row-button) {
        padding: 0 8px;
    }
    .app .row-button:hover:not(:disabled) {
        background: var(--surface-2);
    }
    .app .row-main {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .app .row-title {
        font-weight: 600;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app .row-sub {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app .row-sub a {
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Signal bars: one to four, green from two. */
    .app .bars {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        gap: 2px;
        height: 14px;
    }
    .app .bars i {
        width: 3px;
        border-radius: 1px;
        background: var(--border);
    }
    .app .bars i:nth-child(1) {
        height: 5px;
    }
    .app .bars i:nth-child(2) {
        height: 8px;
    }
    .app .bars i:nth-child(3) {
        height: 11px;
    }
    .app .bars i:nth-child(4) {
        height: 14px;
    }
    .app .bars.good i.on {
        background: var(--good);
    }
    .app .bars.weak i.on {
        background: var(--warn);
    }

    /* ----- Chats: the conversations beside the one open ----- */
    .app .chats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(16rem, 22rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
        min-height: 0;
    }
    .app .list-col {
        border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        overflow-y: auto;
        padding: 16px 12px;
        max-height: calc(100dvh - var(--header-h) - 110px);
    }
    .app .col-head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 0 6px 10px;
    }
    .app .col-head h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
    }
    .app .head-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 6px;
    }
    .app .talks {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }
    .app .talk-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 0;
        padding: 10px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: transparent;
        text-align: left;
    }
    .app .talk-item:hover:not(:disabled) {
        background: var(--surface-2);
    }
    .app .talk-item.on {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
    }
    .app .talk-item .top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .app .talk-item .row-title {
        flex: 1;
    }
    .app .talk-item time {
        flex: none;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
    }
    .app .talk-item .bottom {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .app .talk-item .row-sub {
        flex: 1;
    }
    .app .talk-item.unread .row-sub {
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 500;
    }
    .app .talks .talk-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .app .talks .talk-item {
        flex: 1;
        width: auto;
        min-width: 0;
    }
    .app .row-more {
        flex: none;
        min-height: 32px;
        padding: 4px 6px;
        border-color: transparent;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--muted);
    }
    .app .row-more svg {
        display: block;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
    }
    .app .row-more[aria-expanded="true"] {
        color: var(--text);
        border-color: var(--border);
    }
    /* With a mouse, a row's menu button shows when the row is pointed at or in focus. */
    @media (hover: hover) {
        .app .talk-row:not(:hover):not(:focus-within) .row-more:not([aria-expanded="true"]) {
            opacity: 0;
        }
    }
    .app .row-menu {
        flex-basis: 100%;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        padding: 0 6px 8px;
    }
    .app .talk-head > .actions {
        margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .app .talks .empty {
        padding: 24px 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .app .asked {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        padding: 0;
    }
    .app .asked:empty {
        display: none;
    }
    .app .asked li {
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 12%, var(--surface));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 35%, var(--border));
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .app .asked p {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .app .asked code {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .app .talk {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-width: 0;
        max-height: calc(100dvh - var(--header-h) - 110px);
        background: var(--surface);
    }
    .app .talk-head {
        padding: 14px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .app .talk-head:empty {
        display: none;
    }
    .app .talk-title {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
    }
    .app .talk-title h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app .talk-title .row-main {
        flex: 1;
    }
    .app .back {
        display: none;
        min-height: 36px;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app .talk-head .address {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .app .talk-head details {
        margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .app .talk-head summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app .talk-head details[open] summary {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .app .talk-head details > p {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        margin: 0 0 10px;
    }
    .app .talk-head select {
        width: auto;
        min-height: 30px;
        padding: 3px 8px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .app .messages {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        flex: 1;
        min-height: 16rem;
        overflow-y: auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        background: var(--bg);
    }
    .app .messages li.in,
    .app .messages li.out {
        max-width: min(75%, 34rem);
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 18px;
    }
    .app .messages li.in {
        align-self: flex-start;
        background: var(--theirs);
        border-bottom-left-radius: 6px;
    }
    .app .messages li.out {
        align-self: flex-end;
        background: var(--mine);
        color: #fff;
        border-bottom-right-radius: 6px;
    }
    .app .messages li.out .meta {
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.75);
    }
    .app .messages li.out .actions button {
        color: var(--text);
    }
    .app .messages li.failed {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--text);
        border: 1.5px dashed var(--bad);
    }
    .app .messages li.failed .meta {
        color: var(--bad);
    }
    .app .messages .text {
        margin: 0;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
    }
    .app .messages .who {
        margin: 0 0 2px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--accent);
    }
    .app .messages .actions {
        margin: 6px 0 2px;
    }
    .app .messages .meta {
        margin: 2px 0 0;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: right;
    }
    .app .messages li.in .meta {
        text-align: left;
    }
    /* How it went (version 18): a line under the time, and the two a button that says all of it. */
    .app .messages .route {
        margin: 1px 0 0;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: right;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }
    .app .messages li.in .route {
        text-align: left;
    }
    .app .messages li.out:not(.failed) .route {
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.75);
    }
    .app .messages .meta-button {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 0;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: inherit;
        font: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    .app .messages .meta-button:hover .route,
    .app .messages .meta-button:hover .meta {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .app .messages .empty {
        margin: auto;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 22rem;
    }
    .app .empty-art {
        display: inline-flex;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .app .empty-art svg {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
    }
    .app .empty h3 {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
        color: var(--text);
    }
    .app .empty p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
    }
    .app .compose {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--surface);
    }
    .app .compose input {
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding-left: 16px;
    }
    .app .compose button.send {
        margin: 0;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 7px 16px;
    }
    .app .compose button.send svg {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
    }
    .app #counter {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app .join-code {
        margin: 8px 0 12px;
        max-width: 22rem;
        padding: 14px;
    }
    /* Black on white whatever the theme: some scanners will not read a code the other way round. */
    .app .join-code .qr {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 16rem;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .app .join-code .link {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    .app .talk-head h4 {
        margin: 12px 0 4px;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
    }
    .app .owners {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        padding: 0;
    }
    .app .owners li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 4px 0;
    }
    .app .owners .row-main {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .app form.add-owner {
        max-width: 28rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .app form.share {
        margin: 8px 0 4px;
        max-width: 28rem;
        padding: 14px;
        background: var(--bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    /* ----- Node: its card, then what can be set ----- */
    .app .hero {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        padding: 24px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--hero-top), var(--hero-bottom));
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .app .hero .eyebrow {
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.75);
    }
    .app .hero h2 {
        margin: 4px 0 2px;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    .app .hero .sub {
        margin: 0;
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.8);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
    }
    .app .hero .address {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin: 14px 0 0;
    }
    .app .hero .address code {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.2);
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
    }
    .app .hero button {
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.14);
        border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.25);
        color: #fff;
    }
    .app .hero button:hover:not(:disabled) {
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.24);
        border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.4);
    }
    .app .hero .chips {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 6px;
        margin: 14px 0 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
    }
    .app .hero .chips li {
        padding: 3px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.14);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
    }
    .app .meters {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .app .meter {
        padding: 12px 14px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.18);
    }
    .app .meter .label {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.8);
    }
    .app .meter .value {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 2px 0 8px;
        color: #fff;
    }
    .app .meter .track {
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.18);
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    .app .meter .fill {
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #7ee2b0;
    }
    .app .meter .fill.warn {
        background: #f3c46c;
    }
    .app .hero .facts {
        margin: 14px 0 0;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.85);
    }
    .app .hero .facts a {
        color: #fff;
    }
    .app .update {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, var(--border));
        background: var(--accent-soft);
    }
    .app .update progress {
        width: 100%;
        accent-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .app .update .facts {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin: 4px 0 10px;
    }
    .app .update .warn {
        color: var(--bad);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin: 4px 0 10px;
    }
    .app .state-line {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .app #console pre {
        background: var(--bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
